,"y":-545,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"chara002_2","noIn":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"shake","para":{"x":10,"y":0,"d":0.8,"layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"text":"[show]太美味了！真是太美味了！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_3"}},{"key":"shake","para":{"x":10,"y":0,"d":0.8,"layer":"_root"}},{"key":"text","para":{"text":"[show]我能够救下你真是太幸运了！我都不敢想象今后没有你我该怎么活了！[r][l]我从没有吃过这么好吃的肉串……！[l]","nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"option","para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_4","text":"也太夸张了。"},{"tag":"tag_4","text":"毕竟是失忆者都能做出的料理。"}]}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_4"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","transTime":300,"x":340,"y":-180,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"chara002_2","noIn":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"text":"[cm][show]那你这个失忆病人还蛮能干的！在深渊生活的这两年，我从没吃过这么好吃的东西。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_6"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"text":"[show]至于之前吃过没嘛，那就记不太清了。我又不记得之前的事。[l]","nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"option","para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_21","text":"对了，米托拉好像也失忆过。"}]}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_21"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"text":"[cm][show]嗯，是啊。我们两个同病相怜嘛！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_20"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"text":"[show]而且记忆什么的，在这个深渊里根本一点也不重要。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_5"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2m","layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"text":"[cm][show]比起早就忘掉了的记忆，还是活下去更要紧。[r][l]所以我这两年间，一直在维护这座营地。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_7"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"text":"[show]渐渐的，感觉这样的生活好像也不错。至于记忆什么的嘛，等到了以后再说吧。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_8"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"text":"[show]所以人哪，关键就是要找到想做的事！你呢？你有什么想做的事吗？[l]","nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"option","para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_9","text":"我要离开这座“深渊”。"}]}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_9"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"text":"[show][cm]唉？为什么？[l]","nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"option","para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_12","text":"我也不知道。"},{"tag":"tag_12","text":"只是觉得自己还有很重要的事情要做。"}]}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_12"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"text":"[show][cm]本能地想要离开吗？这么看来，你的记忆可能并没有消失得那么彻底。[r]说不定过一阵子就会全部想起来了……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_34"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"text":"[show]反正我说过，之前的救命之恩什么的，早就一笔勾销了。[r][l]你想直接离开，或者继续在这里呆一段时间都可以。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_22"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"text":"[show]至于这段时间，我看你也不像是能在荒野上生存下去的样子，不如干脆和我一起行动吧！我罩着你！[l]","nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"option","para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_13","text":"谢谢你，米托拉。"},{"tag":"tag_13","text":"那就请你多指教了。"}]}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_13"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"text":"[cm][show]哈哈，真有礼貌。看来你失忆之前肯定是个乖宝宝呢。[l]","nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"option","para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_35","text":"我倒不这么觉得……"}]}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_35"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"text":"[cm][show]是嘛，那不是更好！我有预感，和你在一起，肯定会有更多惊喜！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_36"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"text":"[show]好了，聊天就先聊到这，还有角布林等着我们去“处理”呢！等你准备好了就告诉我吧！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"end","para":{"end":true}}]}